{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2851","id":2968976861,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz886w9v3d","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2851","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2851.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2851.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2851","number":2851,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Domain() to return BaseDomain instead of ServerURL hostname","user":{"login":"Copilot","id":198982749,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tailscale clients were displaying the external control server URL instead of the internal network domain (MagicDNS base_domain), particularly confusing on mobile where both labels showed the same value.\n\n**Root cause:** `Domain()` method was parsing and returning the hostname from `ServerURL` instead of returning `BaseDomain`.\n\n**Changes:**\n- `hscontrol/types/config.go`: Simplified `Domain()` to return `BaseDomain` directly\n- `hscontrol/mapper/builder_test.go`: Fixed test to use distinct ServerURL/BaseDomain values to properly validate behavior\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// Before: Domain() returned \"headscale.example.com\" (from ServerURL)\ncfg := &types.Config{\n    ServerURL:  \"https://headscale.example.com\",\n    BaseDomain: \"internal.mynetwork.com\",\n}\n\n// After: Domain() returns \"internal.mynetwork.com\" (from BaseDomain)\n// Clients now show the tailnet's internal domain, not the control server URL\n```\n\nFixes #2833\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>Original prompt</summary>\n\n> Investigate https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2833\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\n---\n\n✨ Let Copilot coding agent [set things up for you](https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/new?title=✨+Set+up+Copilot+instructions&body=Configure%20instructions%20for%20this%20repository%20as%20documented%20in%20%5BBest%20practices%20for%20Copilot%20coding%20agent%20in%20your%20repository%5D%28https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-tips%29%2E%0A%0A%3COnboard%20this%20repo%3E&assignees=copilot) — coding agent works faster and does higher quality work when set up for your repo.\n","created_at":"2025-11-01T08:28:06Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T16:19:56Z","closed_at":"2025-11-10T16:19:56Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"be86c10ac88c1e33bd8139a2b1c22e398b91178a","assignees":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"http